# astrion-skill v1
goal: Take a 5-minute Pomodoro break
trigger:
  - phrase: "break"
  - phrase: "pomodoro break"
  - phrase: "take a break"
do: |
  Start a 5-minute break timer. Disable Do Not Disturb if it's on
  (focus session likely just ended). Show a notification "5-minute
  break started. Step away from the screen." When timer fires,
  notify "Break over — back to work?" with a button to re-enter
  focus mode.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 200
  reversibility: BOUNDED
